&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;From the high-stakes energy of live corporate events to the behind-the-scenes magic of maintenance, you’ll be the go-to leader making sure every square inch of our space shines. If you’re a pro at juggling logistics, inspiring a diverse team, and turning &quot;good&quot; feedback into &quot;where do i sign for next year&quot; status, we want to meet you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to day operations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overall responsibility for the Events Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the Events operations team and Conference Services Team in all aspects of the operation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the external cleaning contract with monthly review and consistent monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and drive forward the yearly, monthly and unplanned maintenance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that each department works to maintain the highest standards of delivery and customer service in accordance with the company’s standards of performance policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly monitor and review of Front of House operations systems, implementing improvements as appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To review and manage the Health &amp;amp; Safety of the venue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct management of the Events operations team and Conference Services Team and oversee staff rotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To ensure effective communication between all FOH departments and with the wider venue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Looking after our guests:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver the highest levels of customer service across all events&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constantly seek and monitor client feedback, ensuring that records are being kept up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and act upon feedback by providing action plans for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To ensure any complaints are dealt with professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To achieve 90% result in Venue Verdict customer feedback and 9-10 Net Promoter score&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Looking after the purse strings:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess a clear understanding of the company business plan and be responsible for ensuring that all targets relating to FOH are keep in line with the overall objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that all tracking and stock control systems are in place with effective stock rotation and monthly counts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control purchases order systems with operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all invoicing and inventory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Labour management, ensuring we have the right people in the right places&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; financial management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Assisting in the running a profitable venue to help towards the company vision&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational management:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and managing the Client Service and Conference Service departments and teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years leadership experience in event venue management, client/membership experience, hospitality, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain an excellent team to deliver unforgettable experiences for our clients and their guests&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining excellent client communication and relations to ensure the client and their guest have an unforgettable experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re Here For You:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Health and Wellness&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised eye care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised fitness membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program: well-being support and personal advice programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time Off and Work-Life Balance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days annual leave plus bank holidays, and company sick pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial Support and Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest-free loan for rail season tickets &amp;amp; further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised bicycle purchase through Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Professional Development and Recognition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional and personal development support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee recognition and reward programs to mark achievements and milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
